meta {
  name: Generate itinerary
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/itineraries
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "trip_id": {{trip_id}}
  }
}

docs {
  No `days`: the model plans the trip and replaces any existing itinerary. Needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on the server.
  201 with the plan. 422 if the trip is longer than 18 days. 409 if a generation for this trip is already running, the database is busy, or the trip was edited mid-generation. 404 if the trip is gone.
}
